# Configuration used by tests/run_ipmisc_shortrdata.py.
#   BlockIP 10.0.1.98 is the 4-octet value a buggy reader constructs out of
#   the short A record's 2 octets plus the first 2 octets of the next record.
LogOn false
UDPLocal 127.0.0.1:15353
UDPGroup 127.0.0.1:15354 * off
BlockIP 10.0.1.98
UseCache false
MemoryCache true
CacheSize 1048576
DomainStatistic false
ModulesUpdateInterval -1
Hosts
DisabledList
DisabledDomain
IPSubstituting
